          "margin": "0 0 16px",
          "max-width": "68ch"
        },
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Nell learned to throw at evening classes, then spent three years as an apprentice in a country pottery before setting up her own wheel in 2016. The barn now holds two wheels, a glaze kitchen and a gas kiln she built with a friend."
      },
      "ab-p2": {
        "attrs": {},
        "breakpoints": {},
